# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Green Peace School — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values:
#     cp .env.example .env.local
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Email delivery (Resend — https://resend.com) ────────────────────
# 1. Create a free account at https://resend.com
# 2. Verify your domain (or use the built-in onboarding@resend.dev
#    address for quick testing)
# 3. Create an API key and paste it below.
#
# While RESEND_API_KEY is empty the form routes still work — every
# submission is logged to the server console instead of being emailed
# (see lib/email.ts).
RESEND_API_KEY=
EMAIL_FROM=The Green Peace School <onboarding@resend.dev>
EMAIL_TO=admissions@thegreenpeaceschool.ng

# ── Google Search Console (optional) ────────────────────────────────
# 1. Go to https://search.google.com/search-console
# 2. Add your domain (or URL prefix) as a property
# 3. Choose the "HTML tag" verification method and copy the content
#    of the meta tag
# 4. Paste it below and redeploy — the site will emit the tag on
#    every page so you can verify. Then submit /sitemap.xml in
#    Search Console.
# GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
